></a></div></div></div><br><div class=\"row\" style=\"padding:4px 0px;\"><label class=\"col-sm-2 control-label\" style=\"text-align:right;\">Detecting Signature Replay Vulnerabilities in Smart Contracts</label><div class=\"col-sm-10\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-sm-8\"><div class=\"embed-container\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"//www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/XtpGHw4xqgs?enablejsapi=1\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen ></iframe></div></div></div></div></div><script type=\"text/javascript\">pauseOnCloseModal(\"modal-45eda9df-6418-47c0-8b40-9899705fd63c\")</script></div><div class=\"modal-footer\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/details/icse-2026/icse-2026-research-track/156/One-Signature-Multiple-Payments-Demystifying-and-Detecting-Signature-Replay-Vulnera\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default navigate\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-new-window\"></span> All Details</a></span><a href=\"#\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" class=\"btn btn-default\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-remove\"></span> Close</a></div></div></div></div>"},{ "action": "runscript", "value": "$('#modal-45eda9df-6418-47c0-8b40-9899705fd63c').modal({ backdrop: 'static', keyboard: true}, 'show');" },
